IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `kr-ai-domain`
IMPORT `kr-ai-operator`
IMPORT `kr-ai-baseline`

-- Korea: AI Framework Act and Enforcement Decree -- TESTS FROM THE SOURCE.
-- A DRAFT. Not for use as advice.
--
-- Every expected value below was written by hand from the deposited Korean text
-- (kr-ai-act-ko.txt, kr-ai-decree-ko.txt, kr-ai-decree-annex2-ko.txt), not
-- copied from what the encoding computes. Every threshold is tested on both
-- sides: 10^26 floating-point operations (Decree Art 24(1) item 1, "이상", at or
-- above), 1 trillion won, 10 billion won and 1,000,000 daily users (Decree Art
-- 29(1), each "이상"), the order of a violation (Annex 2), the 1.5x increase
-- against the 30,000,000-won ceiling (Annex 2 general criterion 라; Act Art
-- 43(1)), and 2026-01-22 (commencement).

§ `Fixtures`

-- A developer in Korea that provides its own AI.
`a Korean developer` MEANS `The operator` WITH
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS TRUE
    `develops AI and provides it` IS TRUE
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS FALSE
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS FALSE

-- A developer abroad, with no address or office in Korea, whose service reaches
-- users in Korea.
`a foreign developer serving Korea` MEANS `The operator` WITH
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS TRUE
    `develops AI and provides it` IS TRUE
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS FALSE
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS FALSE
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS FALSE
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS FALSE

-- The same developer, with no effect on the Korean market or users.
`a foreign developer not serving Korea` MEANS `The operator` WITH
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS TRUE
    `develops AI and provides it` IS TRUE
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS FALSE
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS FALSE
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS FALSE
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS FALSE
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS FALSE

-- A Korean business that provides a service built on another developer's AI.
`a Korean utilization operator` MEANS `The operator` WITH
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS TRUE
    `develops AI and provides it` IS FALSE
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS TRUE
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS FALSE

-- A developer in Korea whose AI is only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists.
`a defence-only developer` MEANS `The operator` WITH
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS TRUE
    `develops AI and provides it` IS TRUE
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS FALSE
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS TRUE

-- Develops and provides AI, but not as a business related to the AI industry.
`outside the AI industry` MEANS `The operator` WITH
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS FALSE
    `develops AI and provides it` IS TRUE
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS FALSE
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS FALSE

-- In the AI industry, but neither developing-and-providing nor providing on
-- another's AI.
`in the industry, neither kind` MEANS `The operator` WITH
    `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS TRUE
    `develops AI and provides it` IS FALSE
    `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS FALSE
    `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS TRUE
    `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS FALSE

-- AI systems around Decree Art 24(1).
`exactly 10^26` MEANS `The AI system` WITH
    `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS 100000000000000000000000000
    `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS TRUE
    `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS TRUE

`one operation below 10^26` MEANS `The AI system` WITH
    `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS 99999999999999999999999999
    `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS TRUE
    `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS TRUE

`twice 10^26` MEANS `The AI system` WITH
    `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS 200000000000000000000000000
    `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS TRUE
    `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS TRUE

`10^26 but not the most advanced` MEANS `The AI system` WITH
    `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS 100000000000000000000000000
    `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS FALSE
    `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS TRUE

`10^26 but no broad and serious risk` MEANS `The AI system` WITH
    `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS 100000000000000000000000000
    `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS TRUE
    `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS FALSE

-- Scales around Decree Art 29(1).
GIVEN total IS A NUMBER
      ai IS A NUMBER
      users IS A NUMBER
      fined IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `The operator's scale`
`scale` total ai users fined MEANS `The operator's scale` WITH
    `total revenue in the previous year, in won` IS total
    `revenue from AI services in the previous year, in won` IS ai
    `average daily users in Korea over the last three months of the previous year` IS users
    `has been fined under Article 43(1) item 3` IS fined

-- Products for Art 31(1).
GIVEN hi IS A BOOLEAN
      gen IS A BOOLEAN
      obvious IS A BOOLEAN
      internal IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The product or service`
`product` hi gen obvious internal MEANS `The product or service` WITH
    `uses high-impact AI` IS hi
    `uses generative AI` IS gen
    `that it uses such AI is obvious from its name, screen, surface or output` IS obvious
    `is used only for the operator's internal business` IS internal

GIVEN failure IS A `Finable failure`
      earlier IS A NUMBER
      arrears IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Fine answer`
`fine` failure earlier arrears MEANS `Annex 2: the fine for the violation` (`The violation` WITH
    `failure` IS failure
    `order of the highest fine for the same violation in the previous two years` IS earlier
    `the operator is in arrears with a fine` IS arrears)

`item 1` MEANS `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires`
`item 2` MEANS `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires`
`item 3` MEANS `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)`

