#ASSERT NOT (`Article 4: the Act reaches the conduct` `a defence-only developer`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the Act binds the operator` `outside the AI industry`)

§ `3. Decree Article 24(1): the three criteria, and 10^26 on both sides`

#ASSERT `Decree Article 24(1): the system meets the Article 32 criteria` `exactly 10^26`
#ASSERT NOT (`Decree Article 24(1): the system meets the Article 32 criteria` `one operation below 10^26`)
#ASSERT `Decree Article 24(1): the system meets the Article 32 criteria` `twice 10^26`
#ASSERT NOT (`Decree Article 24(1): the system meets the Article 32 criteria` `10^26 but not the most advanced`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Decree Article 24(1): the system meets the Article 32 criteria` `10^26 but no broad and serious risk`)

§ `4. Article 32: the safety obligation`

#ASSERT (`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`
#ASSERT (`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `I must identify, assess and mitigate risks across the AI life cycle`
#ASSERT (`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `I must build a risk-management system that monitors and responds to AI safety incidents`
#ASSERT (`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `I must submit the results of those measures to the Minister of Science and ICT`
#ASSERT (`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `within how many days the results must be submitted` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT ((`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean developer` `one operation below 10^26`)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`)
#ASSERT NOT ((`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean developer` `one operation below 10^26`)'s `I must submit the results of those measures to the Minister of Science and ICT`)
#ASSERT (`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a foreign developer serving Korea` `twice 10^26`)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`
#ASSERT NOT ((`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a foreign developer not serving Korea` `twice 10^26`)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`)
#ASSERT NOT ((`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a defence-only developer` `twice 10^26`)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`)
-- Article 32 binds 인공지능사업자, every AI business operator (fork F5).
#ASSERT (`Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `a Korean utilization operator` `exactly 10^26`)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`

§ `5. No incident-reporting duty; the nearest duty`

#ASSERT NOT ((`must the operator report an AI incident` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `a duty to report an AI incident is stated in the Act or the Decree`)
#ASSERT (`must the operator report an AI incident` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `to whom an incident must be reported` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`must the operator report an AI incident` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `within how many days an incident must be reported` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`must the operator report an AI incident` `a Korean developer` `exactly 10^26`)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `Article 32(1) item 2 and Article 32(2): build a risk-management system that monitors and responds to AI safety incidents, and submit the results of the Article 32(1) measures to the Minister; neither is a duty to report an incident`
#ASSERT NOT ((`must the operator report an AI incident` `a Korean developer` `one operation below 10^26`)'s `a duty to report an AI incident is stated in the Act or the Decree`)
#ASSERT (`must the operator report an AI incident` `a Korean developer` `one operation below 10^26`)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `none for this system: Article 32 does not bind it, and no provision of the Act or the Decree requires any operator to report an incident`
#ASSERT (`must the operator report an AI incident` `a foreign developer not serving Korea` `twice 10^26`)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `none: the Act does not bind this operator for this conduct (Article 2(7), Article 4)`
#ASSERT (`must the operator report an AI incident` `a foreign developer serving Korea` `twice 10^26`)'s `within how many days an incident must be reported` EQUALS NOTHING

