§ `10. Article 32 is not itself finable; no grace period in law`

#ASSERT `Article 43(1): a failure under Article 32 is not itself finable, on` (Date 24 10 2026) EQUALS `not fined directly: Article 43(1) does not list Article 32; after an Article 40 investigation the Minister may order a breach suspended or corrected (Article 40(3)), and not carrying out that order is finable under Article 43(1) item 3`
#ASSERT `a grace period in law on` (Date 24 10 2026) EQUALS `none in law: the Act, the Decree and Annex 2 contain no grace period and no suspension of investigations or fines; a grace period announced by the government, if any, is policy, not law, and was not read`

§ `11. Commencement on both sides of 2026-01-22`

#ASSERT `the Act and the Decree in force on` (Date 21 1 2026) EQUALS `not yet in force`
#ASSERT `the Act and the Decree in force on` (Date 22 1 2026) EQUALS `in force`
#ASSERT `the Act and the Decree in force on` (Date 24 10 2026) EQUALS `in force`

